#: ../../../reference/accessibility/dbus/org.a11y.atspi.Action.md:41
msgid ""
"Returns: The localized description for the action at the specified `index`. "
"For example, a screen reader will read out this description when the user "
"asks for extra detail on an action. For example, \\\"Clicks the button\\\" "
"for the \\\"click\\\" action of a button."
msgstr ""

